{
  "esm": "1.3.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "str_dx_cell_k2",
    "description": "Scalar atom of the CICE stress-combination algebra: str(i,j,2), the NW-corner contribution to the x divergence of the internal stress at the U point U(i,j) (stress, ice_dyn_evp.F90:1731-1732): str2 = strp_tmp + strm_tmp - str12we + dxhy*(-csigpnw + csigmnw) + dyhx*csig12nw, with strp_tmp/strm_tmp = p25*dyT*(p333*ssigpn + p166*ssigps) (F90:1723-1724), str12we = p5*dxT*(p333*ssig12w + p166*ssig12e) (F90:1716), csigpnw/csigmnw = p111*p2 + p055*(p1+p3) + p027*p4 (F90:1697, 1702) and csig12nw = p222*s2 + p111*(s1+s3) + p055*s4 (F90:1708). Params and structure as on str_dx_cell_k1; the rule binds the p/m/s values of the NW cell (i+1,j) around the U point.",
    "license": "MIT",
    "tags": ["esd:stencil", "family:cice_bgrid", "grid:cice_bgrid", "op:stress"],
    "references": [
      {
        "citation": "Hunke, E. C., et al. (2023). CICE v6.3.22 documentation and user's guide (LA-UR-23-31851), the stress() corner combinations."
      }
    ]
  },
  "expression_template_imports": [
    { "ref": "./str_csig.esm" },
    { "ref": "./str_pairsum_lin.esm" }
  ],
  "expression_templates": {
    "str_dx_cell_k2": {
      "params": ["p1", "p2", "p3", "p4", "m1", "m2", "m3", "m4", "s1", "s2", "s3", "s4", "dxT", "dyT", "dxhy", "dyhx"],
      "body": {
        "op": "+",
        "args": [
          {
            "op": "+",
            "args": [
              {
                "op": "apply_expression_template",
                "args": [],
                "name": "str_pairsum_lin",
                "bindings": { "a1": "p1", "a2": "p2", "a3": "p3", "a4": "p4", "c": 0.25, "metric": "dyT" }
              },
              {
                "op": "apply_expression_template",
                "args": [],
                "name": "str_pairsum_lin",
                "bindings": { "a1": "m1", "a2": "m2", "a3": "m3", "a4": "m4", "c": 0.25, "metric": "dyT" }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "op": "-",
            "args": [
              {
                "op": "apply_expression_template",
                "args": [],
                "name": "str_pairsum_lin",
                "bindings": { "a1": "s2", "a2": "s3", "a3": "s1", "a4": "s4", "c": 0.5, "metric": "dxT" }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "op": "*",
            "args": [
              "dxhy",
              {
                "op": "+",
                "args": [
                  {
                    "op": "-",
                    "args": [
                      {
                        "op": "apply_expression_template",
                        "args": [],
                        "name": "str_csig",
                        "bindings": { "a1": "p2", "a2": "p1", "a3": "p4", "a4": "p3", "c1": { "op": "/", "args": [1, 9] }, "c2": { "op": "/", "args": [1, 18] }, "c3": { "op": "/", "args": [1, 36] } }
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "op": "apply_expression_template",
                    "args": [],
                    "name": "str_csig",
                    "bindings": { "a1": "m2", "a2": "m1", "a3": "m4", "a4": "m3", "c1": { "op": "/", "args": [1, 9] }, "c2": { "op": "/", "args": [1, 18] }, "c3": { "op": "/", "args": [1, 36] } }
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "op": "*",
            "args": [
              "dyhx",
              {
                "op": "apply_expression_template",
                "args": [],
                "name": "str_csig",
                "bindings": { "a1": "s2", "a2": "s1", "a3": "s4", "a4": "s3", "c1": { "op": "/", "args": [2, 9] }, "c2": { "op": "/", "args": [1, 9] }, "c3": { "op": "/", "args": [1, 18] } }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  }
}
